'''''Frankenia pulverulenta''''', the '''European seaheath''', is a species of annual herb in the family [[Frankenia]]ceae. They have a self-supporting growth form and simple, broad leaves. Individuals can grow to 5&nbsp;cm tall.<ref>{{Cite web|title=Frankenia pulverulenta L. - Encyclopedia of Life|url=https://eol.org/pages/487544|access-date=2022-02-04|website=eol.org}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |last=Mifsud |first=Stephen |date=2002-08-23 |title=Frankenia pulverulenta (Annual Sea Heath) : MaltaWildPlants.com - the online Flora of the Maltese Islands. |url=https://www.maltawildplants.com/FRNK/Frankenia_pulverulenta.php |access-date=2022-03-03 |website=www.maltawildplants.com |language=en-us}}</ref>

